        "terms": "<p>Early holiday pricing applies from Nov 10 to Nov 26, 2026 on popdartsgame.com to eligible products shown on this page with a sale price. The saving shown on each product is already applied — no code needed; taxes and shipping are calculated at checkout. This is not a sitewide sale. Elite products, gift cards and slightly used or returned items are excluded. While supplies last; prices and availability may change.</p><p>Sale items are final sale and can't be returned (<a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Refund Policy</a>). If an item arrives damaged, defective or incorrect, email Support@popdartsgame.com right away. Orders are processed within 1–2 business days, excluding weekends and holidays; shipping options and rates are shown at checkout, and delivery times depend on the option you choose (<a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy</a>). International shipping is available for select products; duties are paid by the customer.</p>"
      }
